# Where the browser sends API requests. Leave unset in development: Vite proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# For a separately hosted backend, set the full URL, including /api/v1, at BUILD time (for example in the Vercel project settings).
# The backend must be served over https, and its VOXSHIELD_CORS_ORIGINS must include this site's address.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
